# Project Stack
- Backend: NestJS + TypeScript, FastAPI + Pydantic
- Frontend: Next.js + TypeScript
- Scripting allowed: Python

# Non-Negotiables (Clean Code)
- Code and identifiers must be in English.
- Avoid abbreviations and generic names (data, info, value, item).
- Booleans must start with: is / has / can / should / does.
- No magic numbers. Use named constants.
- Prefer early returns. Avoid else blocks when possible.
- Avoid nested conditionals. Keep logic linear.
- Comments explain WHY (limitations/workarounds/decisions), not WHAT.
- Small iterations: implement -> test -> refactor -> review.

# Quality Gate
- Every new behavior requires tests (happy path + at least 2 edge cases), using pytest for Python services.
- Controllers must stay thin (no business logic).
- UI render must stay clean (no heavy JS inside JSX).
